<title>JAPAN: Daido Hoxan says merger with Tateho Chem an option.</title>
<headline>Daido Hoxan says merger with Tateho Chem an option.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daido Hoxan Inc said on Friday that a merger with Tateho Chemical Industries Co Ltd is one option, but no final decision has been made yet.  </p>
<p>At the same time, Tateho Chemical said in a statement that although it was looking into the possibility of restructuring on its own, the repayment of loans would take time.</p>
<p>Tateho Chemical said on Monday that on a group basis the company's liabilities appeared to have exceeded its assets by about 1.4 billion yen in the financial year that ended on March 31.</p>
</text>
